MAIN

PRINT CALL BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 2 BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 3 HALLOCATE 4
MOVE TEMP 4 HALLOCATE 4
HSTORE TEMP 3 0 ArrayUpdate_TestUpdate
MOVE TEMP 5 4
L0	CJUMP LE TEMP 5 3 L1
HSTORE PLUS TEMP 4 TEMP 5 0 0
MOVE TEMP 5 PLUS TEMP 5 4
JUMP L0
L1 HSTORE TEMP 4 0 TEMP 3
RETURN TEMP 4
END

HLOAD TEMP 6 TEMP 2 0
HLOAD TEMP 7 TEMP 6 0
RETURN TEMP 7
END ( TEMP 2 )
END

ArrayUpdate_TestUpdate [ 1 ]
BEGIN

MOVE TEMP 1 BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 5 HALLOCATE  TIMES  PLUS 3 1  4
MOVE TEMP 6 4
L2 CJUMP  LE TEMP 6 MINUS  TIMES  PLUS 3 1  4  1 L3
HSTORE  PLUS TEMP 5 TEMP 6 0  0
MOVE TEMP 6 PLUS TEMP 6 4
JUMP L2
L3 HSTORE TEMP 5 0 3
RETURN TEMP 5
END


HSTORE PLUS TEMP 1 TIMES 4 0 4 100

HSTORE PLUS TEMP 1 TIMES 4 1 4 200

HSTORE PLUS TEMP 1 TIMES 4 2 4 300

MOVE TEMP 2 BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 7 PLUS TEMP 1 TIMES 4 1
HLOAD TEMP 8 TEMP 7 4
RETURN TEMP 8
END


PRINT TEMP 2

HSTORE PLUS TEMP 1 TIMES 4 1 4 999

MOVE TEMP 3 BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 9 PLUS TEMP 1 TIMES 4 1
HLOAD TEMP 10 TEMP 9 4
RETURN TEMP 10
END


PRINT TEMP 3

MOVE TEMP 2 BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 11 PLUS TEMP 1 TIMES 4 0
HLOAD TEMP 12 TEMP 11 4
RETURN TEMP 12
END


MOVE TEMP 3 BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 13 PLUS TEMP 1 TIMES 4 2
HLOAD TEMP 14 TEMP 13 4
RETURN TEMP 14
END


MOVE TEMP 4 PLUS TEMP 2 TEMP 3

HSTORE PLUS TEMP 1 TIMES 4 1 4 TEMP 4

MOVE TEMP 4 BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 15 PLUS TEMP 1 TIMES 4 1
HLOAD TEMP 16 TEMP 15 4
RETURN TEMP 16
END


PRINT TEMP 4

RETURN 0
END

